    "faq_gMHeJ9": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_XzG8cq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is a walking pad best used for?",
            "content": "<p>A walking pad is best used for <strong>daily light activity and staying active at home or in the office</strong>.</p><p>It is ideal for <strong>walking while working, increasing daily step count, light cardio, and low-intensity exercise</strong> without taking up much space or interrupting your routine. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_6xTRiR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use a walking pad while working?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, walking pads are designed for <strong>walking while working</strong>, especially in a <strong>home office or desk setup</strong>. 💻</p><p>They allow you to stay active during the day by combining <strong>light walking with computer work, meetings, or watching content</strong>, without interrupting your routine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_aNipQt": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_CU6K8B": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I run on a walking pad?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, you can run on a walking pad, but the <strong>maximum speed is usually limited compared to a regular treadmill</strong>.</p><p>It is mainly designed for <strong>walking and light jogging</strong>, but you can still do short or light running sessions depending on your pace and comfort level. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_YcNgYG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do walking pads require assembly?",
            "content": "<p>Most walking pads require <strong>little to no assembly</strong>.</p><p>They are usually <strong>ready to use out of the box or only need very simple setup</strong>, such as plugging in the power and placing them on a flat surface. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JXTFWR": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do walking pads take up a lot of space?",
            "content": "<p>No, walking pads are designed to be <strong>ultra-compact and space-saving</strong>.</p><p>They can usually be <strong>slid under a bed, sofa, or desk</strong> when not in use, making them ideal for small apartments and home offices. 👍</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_8tBmKc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to pay extra for shipping or taxes?",
            "content": "<p><strong>No, you don't.</strong> All WELLFIT products come with <strong>free shipping and no additional taxes, </strong>consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax</strong>. The price you see on our website is the final price — no hidden fees at checkout.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_h6dwNV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon will I receive my order after purchase?",
            "content": "<p>We ship from <strong>7 U.S. warehouses</strong> located in <strong>California, Georgia, Texas, New Jersey, Houston, and New York. </strong>Most orders are delivered within <strong>1–5 business days</strong>, depending on your location.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_8JPgFN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does WELLFIT stand for?",
            "content": "<p>WELLFIT was born from a personal journey toward better health—and we’ve grown to support over <strong>30,000+ people</strong> in making fitness not just a routine, but a <strong>lifestyle</strong>. We believe that staying active shouldn’t be a struggle—it should be an empowering, sustainable habit.</p><p>Our vision is to help more people live <strong>healthier, freer lives</strong>, and face each day with energy and optimism.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
